We hope that this special issue will provide the readers some representative and exciting views regarding the new development and utilization of MOFs and MOF-related materials. Due to the dynamic nature of this rapidly growing field, it is impossible to cover every main aspect of this field. There is no doubt that the research field of MOFs will continue to expand, with contributions from not only chemists, but also material scientists and engineers. We do hope that readers will enjoy the scope of topics presented here and perhaps find inspiration to push this field to the next stage.
